	(text_box "Ren1 and Ren2 are technically calculated for a 12.0 - 12.2V hysteresis as per the datasheet.\nEffectively this is more like 11.4-11.8V hysteresis.\nWorkarounds can be :\n- An inline diode at 1V\n- 133k - 14.3k Ren1-2 pair for 12.35-12.75V hysteresis\n- 150k - 15k Ren1-2 pair for 13.15-13.6 hysteresis"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.67 97.79 0)
		(size 67.31 17.78)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
